00:33:07.686 --> 00:33:10.122 position:63%
Sidley, BC. Townsite.

00:33:10.855 --> 00:33:15.418 position:63%
So a customs collector
settled here in 1889.

00:33:16.027 --> 00:33:19.497 position:63%
Started an international town,
general store, saloon,

00:33:19.564 --> 00:33:22.066 position:63%
