00:34:09.283 --> 00:34:13.351 position:63%
Like, there are two systems
rubbing up against one another.

00:34:13.418 --> 00:34:17.055 position:63%
One system is going to have
some sort of advantage over the other.

00:34:17.122 --> 00:34:18.309 position:63%
And vice versa.

00:34:18.857 --> 00:34:20.291 position:63%
There's always money to be made.

00:34:20.358 --> 00:34:23.528 position:63%
So in those times, it was prohibition.

00:34:23.595 --> 00:34:26.464 position:63%
They could sell alcohol in Canada,
in the US they couldn't.

00:34:26.531 --> 00:34:30.837 position:63%
So the opportunity was
just getting that alcohol

00:34:31.344 --> 00:34:33.411 position:63%
