00:34:45.884 --> 00:34:48.879 position:63%
And if they weren't moonshining,
well, they had to buy the real stuff.

00:34:48.946 --> 00:34:52.502 position:63%
And up here,
a lot of that was coming over.

00:34:52.569 --> 00:34:55.330 position:63%
It crossed easily
