00:35:46.794 --> 00:35:47.794 position:63%
That's too bad.

00:35:49.014 --> 00:35:53.851 position:63%
Prior to a mineral entry in 1896,
a Chinese man named Chee Saw

00:35:53.918 --> 00:35:56.955 position:63%
