00:36:12.483 --> 00:36:17.474 position:63%
Standard story, one of these guys
with a lot of risk-taking and courage

00:36:17.541 --> 00:36:19.677 position:63%
sets up a town, basically.

00:36:19.744 --> 00:36:22.809 position:63%
Let's see what's going on here, Tavern.

00:36:26.535 --> 00:36:29.526 position:63%
[door creaks]

00:36:30.622 --> 00:36:33.472 position:63%
