each other get loads of wood and stuff.

00:36:36.235 --> 00:36:38.030 position:63%
You know, it's like community.

00:36:38.097 --> 00:36:40.933 position:63%
-It has to be old school because
you don't have cell phone coverage.

00:36:41.000 --> 00:36:44.431 position:63%
Right. You don't have the technology,
so you have to learn to depend on…

00:36:44.498 --> 00:36:48.206 position:63%
